tRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"10八月，庚戌，以昭儀王氏爲德妃，昭容楊氏爲賢妃。立敬宗之子休復爲梁王，執中爲襄王，言楊爲杞王，成美爲陳王。癸丑，立皇子宗儉爲蔣王。","content_fanyi":"八月庚戌日，册昭仪王氏为德妃，昭容杨氏为贤妃；封敬宗之子李休复为梁王、李执中为襄王、李言杨为杞王、李成美为陈王。癸丑日，封皇子李宗俭为蒋王。","content_jianti_auto":"10八月，庚戌，以昭仪王氏为德妃，昭容杨氏为贤妃。立敬宗之子休复为梁王，执中为襄王，言杨为杞王，成美为陈王。癸丑，立皇子宗俭为蒋王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24971,"number":10,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c4170cd0-db0e-11ef-a7a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"河陽軍士","official_note":"河陽軍士指駐守河陽地區的士兵，屬於地方軍事單位，在唐代河陽為重要軍鎮，此處描述他們驅逐李泳後意圖作亂，反映了地方軍士的動盪。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"河陽軍士旣逐李泳","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"270fe45b-7c95-431a-8f5c-8956ab5c98a8"},{"confidence":0.7,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"李執方","official_note":"李執方在此處擔任處理軍亂的官員，可能為地方長官或軍事指揮官，負責鎮壓叛亂並恢復秩序，但原文未明確其具體官職，僅提及人名。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"李執方索得首亂者七十餘人","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"414ea01c-fa7b-4bc6-a8f7-c3975d4809d3"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"节度使李泳。","link_td_id":"Q10025202","people_name":"李泳","people_name_jianti_auto":"李泳","people_xingming":"李泳","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"c4183d5b-db0e-11ef-97b2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李執方","people_name_jianti_auto":"李执方","people_xingming":"李执方","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"c4183d5c-db0e-11ef-8edc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"河陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"河阳","place_note":"总部设河阳县【河南省孟州市】","resolved_place_entity_id":220,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c4183d5d-db0e-11ef-9b55-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"11河陽軍士旣逐李泳，日相扇，欲爲亂。九月，李執方索得首亂者七十餘人，悉斬之，餘黨分隸外鎭，然後定。","content_fanyi":"河阳的军士把节度使李泳赶走以后，天天互相煽动，企图作乱。九月，新任节度使李执方查获带头作乱的七十多人，将他们全部斩首，其余党羽分别编配到外镇，局势这才安定下来。","content_jianti_auto":"11河阳军士既逐李泳，日相扇，欲为乱。九月，李执方索得首乱者七十余人，悉斩之，余党分隶外镇，然后定。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24972,"number":11,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c4170cea-db0e-11ef-a06d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"劉昫","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘昫","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c4183d60-db0e-11ef-9ab4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭覃","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑覃","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c4183d61-db0e-11ef-9f94-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蔡邕","people_name_jianti_auto":"蔡邕","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"c4183d62-db0e-11ef-be59-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"c4183d63-db0e-11ef-ba29-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"劉昫曰：時上好文，鄭覃以宰臣判國子祭酒，依後漢蔡邕刊碑列於太學，創立石壁九經，諸儒校正訛謬。上又令翰林勒字官校字體，又乖師法。故石經立後數十年，名儒皆不窺之，以爲蕪累。","note_content_jianti_auto":"刘昫曰：时上好文，郑覃以宰臣判国子祭酒，依后汉蔡邕刊碑列于太学，创立石壁九经，诸儒校正讹谬。上又令翰林勒字官校字体，又乖师法。故石经立后数十年，名儒皆不窥之，以为芜累。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"c4183d5f-db0e-11ef-8308-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"國子監","official_note":"國子監是唐代中央教育機構，負責管理國學和監察教育事務，此處指國子監負責的石經刻成，顯示其在文教方面的職能。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"國子監石經成","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"991766e4-b551-40ce-b030-e31e27892f03"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background